<pre class=metadata>
Title: Blockquote Mixed Indents With Opaque Blocks
Group: test
Shortname: foo
Level: 1
Status: LS
ED: http://example.com/foo
Abstract: Mixed-indentation linting checks outer indentation before `>` on blockquote lines containing `<pre>` or fenced code, without linting indentation inside the opaque content itself.
Editor: Example Editor
Date: 1970-01-01
Markup Shorthands: markdown on, markdown-blockquotes on
Complain About: mixed-indents yes
Boilerplate: omit document-revision
</pre>

