* Outer list item:
    > <pre>
	> tab before > inside pre (should lint)
    > 	tab inside pre after > (should NOT lint)
	> </pre>

* Second list item:
    > ```
	> tab before > inside fenced code (should lint)
    > 	tab inside fenced code after > (should NOT lint)
	> ```

<pre>
	tab inside top-level pre (should NOT lint)
</pre>
